Items.Ember_Workshop_Crossbow.name = Workshop Crossbow
Items.Ember_Workshop_Crossbow.description = MK1. Hold primary for at least 0.6 s, then release. Uses one standard arrow. 12–25 random base damage; 1.3 s shot interval.
Items.Ember_Shotgun.name = Ember Shotgun
Items.Ember_Shotgun.description = MK3. One shell fires seven pellets (7 damage each). Wide spread, short effective range, 1.5 s shot interval.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Shotgun.name = Shotgun Shell
Items.Ember_Ammo_Shotgun.description = For the Ember Shotgun. One shell per seven-pellet shot.
Items.Ember_Flamethrower.name = Ember Flamethrower
Items.Ember_Flamethrower.description = MK3. Hold primary: 5-block flame stream. Uses 0.4 fuel seconds per burst. MK1–Infinite fuels load from inventory. Continuous fire overheats after nine bursts; 6 s lockout. Secondary shows fuel and heat.
Items.Ember_Induction_Rifle.name = Induction Rifle
Items.Ember_Induction_Rifle.description = MK4. Hold primary for 1.2 s, then release. 52 base damage (32 bypass resistance). Uses one metal slug and one energy charge. Each energy cell supplies eight shots. No resources spent on an early release.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Induction.name = Induction Slug
Items.Ember_Ammo_Induction.description = Induction Rifle ammunition. Also requires energy cells.
Items.Ember_Energy_Cell.name = Weapon Energy Cell
Items.Ember_Energy_Cell.description = Supplies eight Coil Thrower or Induction Rifle shots. Loads automatically from inventory.
Items.Ember_Hammer_MK2.name = Ember Hammer MK2
Items.Ember_Hammer_MK2.description = MK2. Hold primary for charged swings. Guard with secondary. Build signature energy through combat, then use the signature groundslam: 65 base damage, 2.5-block radius.
Items.Ember_Hammer_MK3.name = Ember Hammer MK3
Items.Ember_Hammer_MK3.description = MK3. Hold primary for charged swings. Guard with secondary. Build signature energy through combat, then use the signature groundslam: 80 base damage, 3-block radius.
Items.Ember_Hammer_MK4.name = Ember Hammer MK4
Items.Ember_Hammer_MK4.description = MK4. Hold primary for charged swings. Guard with secondary. Build signature energy through combat, then use the signature groundslam: 96 base damage, 3.5-block radius.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Pollen_Slow.name = Slowing Pollen Capsule
Items.Ember_Ammo_Pollen_Slow.description = For the Pollen Launcher. Bursts in a 2-block radius. Slows for 40 seconds.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Pollen_Marking.name = Marking Pollen Capsule
Items.Ember_Ammo_Pollen_Marking.description = For the Pollen Launcher. Bursts in a 2-block radius. Marks for 80 seconds.
Items.Ember_Ammo_Pollen_Poison.name = Poison Pollen Capsule
Items.Ember_Ammo_Pollen_Poison.description = For the Pollen Launcher. Bursts in a 2-block radius. Poison lasts 30 seconds. Starts at 2 damage and doubles each second (2, 4, 8, 16...). A new application restarts at 2.
Items.Ember_Pollen_Launcher.name = Pollen Launcher
Items.Ember_Pollen_Launcher.description = MK3. Secondary cycles slowing, marking and poison capsules. Primary fires the selected capsule. Impact radius 2 blocks; slow 40 s, mark 80 s, poison 30 s. Poison starts at 2 damage and doubles each tick (2, 4, 8, 16...). No automatic substitution of capsule types.
